{"seq":92,"slug":"game-economy-simulation","title":"游戏经济模拟","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation","rating":{"composite":4.24,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"游戏经济模拟\">游戏经济模拟</h1><p>游戏经济模拟是用数学模型、仿真技术和系统工程方法，在游戏上线之前预测和验证虚拟经济行为的学科。它回答的核心问题是：<strong>如果这样设计货币水龙头和水槽，六个月后货币存量会是多少？玩家会感到穷还是富？系统会崩溃吗？</strong></p>\n<p>本 hub 与同类 hub 的边界划分如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>game-economy-balancing（09）</strong>：聚焦设计直觉和平衡调整手感，依赖定性判断和迭代测试；本 hub 偏向<strong>数学建模和系统仿真</strong>，在游戏启动之前用代码和公式预测经济走势。</li>\n<li><strong>game-monetization-liveops（15）</strong>：关注商业化策略、活动设计和直播运营决策；本 hub 关注的是这些决策背后的<strong>经济学基础和量化分析工具</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>game-data-driven-design（58）</strong>：使用已有玩家数据做事后归因和 A/B 测试；本 hub 在数据匮乏的<strong>设计早期阶段</strong>利用仿真预判经济风险。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-的覆盖范围\">本 hub 的覆盖范围</h2><p><strong>第 1 章 — 经济系统基础</strong>：虚拟经济的设计原则、双货币体系、货币水龙头与水槽的流量平衡表、供需建模与弹性函数。这是构建仿真模型的理论地基。</p>\n<p><strong>第 2 章 — 模拟技术</strong>：基于代理的仿真（ABM）、蒙特卡洛经济预测和均衡分析三大核心仿真方法。工程师能在这里找到可落地的代码框架和算法实现。</p>\n<p><strong>第 3 章 — 经济子系统</strong>：市场与拍卖系统（订单簿、荷兰式拍卖）、制作与资源链（DAG 分析、瓶颈识别）、进度与奖励节奏（变比强化、进度门控）三个具体子系统的设计与仿真。</p>\n<p><strong>第 4 章 — 运营与调控</strong>：经济监控指标体系（Gini 系数、ARPDAU 拆解）、通胀通缩调控机制（央行工具）、外挂与 RMT 对策（行为聚类检测）。这是经济系统上线后维持健康的工程保障。</p>\n<h2 id=\"目标读者\">目标读者</h2><p>面向具有 3-7 年经验的中级游戏开发工程师，尤其是负责游戏系统设计、后端服务或数据工程的工程师。读者需要具备基础的概率论和 Python/TypeScript 编程能力。不需要经济学博士学位，但需要有「我想用代码验证这个设计假设」的工程师思维。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><code>hubs/16_game-development/09_game-economy-balancing</code>：平衡调整的直觉与实践</li>\n<li><code>hubs/16_game-development/15_game-monetization-liveops</code>：商业化策略与活动运营</li>\n<li><code>hubs/16_game-development/58_game-data-driven-design</code>：数据驱动设计与 A/B 测试</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals","title":"经济系统基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"virtual-economy-principles","title":"虚拟经济设计原则与双货币体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/fundamentals/virtual-economy-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"faucet-sink-balance","title":"货币水龙头与水槽","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/fundamentals/faucet-sink-balance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"supply-demand-modeling","title":"供需建模与弹性定价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/fundamentals/supply-demand-modeling"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"simulation","title":"模拟技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/simulation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"agent-based-simulation","title":"基于代理的经济仿真","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/simulation/agent-based-simulation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"monte-carlo-forecast","title":"蒙特卡洛经济预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/simulation/monte-carlo-forecast"},{"seq":3,"slug":"equilibrium-analysis","title":"均衡分析与博弈论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/simulation/equilibrium-analysis"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"systems","title":"经济子系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"market-auction-systems","title":"市场与拍卖系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/systems/market-auction-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"crafting-resource-chain","title":"制作与资源链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/systems/crafting-resource-chain"},{"seq":3,"slug":"progression-reward-pacing","title":"进度与奖励节奏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/systems/progression-reward-pacing"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运营与调控","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"economy-monitoring-metrics","title":"经济监控指标体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/operations/economy-monitoring-metrics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inflation-deflation-control","title":"通胀通缩调控机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/operations/inflation-deflation-control"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bot-rmt-countermeasures","title":"外挂与 RMT 对策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-economy-simulation/operations/bot-rmt-countermeasures"}]}]}